  "body": "Positioned right on Takapuna Beach within the tightly held Mon Desir complex, this north facing apartment presents a rare opportunity to secure true beachfront living in one of the North Shore's most sought after locations. Generous in scale at approximately 125sqm, it offers a spacious overall footprint that is increasingly hard to find in modern apartment living.\r\n\r\nEnjoy outstanding natural light throughout the day, with a north facing aspect capturing sun across the main living areas, while dual aspects also provide morning light and sea views to the east, and warm afternoon sun to the west. Two generous balconies offer the perfect setting for morning coffee with the sea, and evening entertaining in the sun.\r\n\r\nThe well considered layout offers two double bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk in wardrobe, while the advantage of two car parks, a large storage room, and additional visitor parking provides a level of convenience seldom found in apartment living.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy resort style living with manicured grounds, a heated pool, gym, and direct gated access to Takapuna Beach, all just metres from cafés, restaurants, and shops.\r\n\r\nOpportunities in this position are rarely available. Act quickly to secure your place on the beachfront.",
